# CODEOWNERS — review owners for binary / authoring assets
#
# These globs request a code-owner review before merge so that changes to
# binary Unreal assets, master authoring sources, and C++/content modules get
# a second set of eyes.
#
# NOTE: CODEOWNERS only requests review. It does NOT block merge on its own —
# you must enable "Require review from Code Owners" in the branch protection
# rule for the default branch (GitHub Settings → Branches).
#
# Owner: repo owner. Adjust the @owner handle/team to your org as needed.

# --- Binary Unreal assets ---
*.uasset    @markwuenschel-dev
*.umap      @markwuenschel-dev

# --- Master Substance graphs (human-owned authoring source) ---
*.sbs       @markwuenschel-dev
*.sbsar     @markwuenschel-dev

# --- C++ runtime / editor modules (Source/WorldForge*) ---
/Plugins/WorldForge/Source/    @markwuenschel-dev

# --- CoreTerrainMaterials content plugin (master materials live here) ---
/Plugins/CoreTerrainMaterials/    @markwuenschel-dev
